240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740508/a725ee50-4aea-4896-9985-028604697a61.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740508/a725ee50-4aea-4896-9985-028604697a61.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"This well-equipped flat is located in a former railway station building from 1914. It is close to Lübben in the Spreewald biosphere reserve. The 3-room flat was renovated very lavishly with eco colors and material in 2022. The large fenced garden can also be used. Pets are welcome. Berlin is only 1 hour away.\n\n100 MBit Hybrid Internet with Wlan (Telekom). \nPlease note that the tracks are still active and trains pass by. The train stop is 50 m away. The train leaves every hour.\n\nThe flat has 2 bedrooms, a living room, a separate kitchen, a hallway and a bathroom. A large fenced plot (1,700 sqm) belongs to the house, which can be used and is particularly suitable for children and pets.\n\nThe station is located directly at the railway tracks, which has the advantage that the station is only 50 m away. Both bedrooms are located on the opposite side of the train rails.\n\nThe large fenced garden, which is mostly natural, can be shared. Children and pets are very welcome. Garden furniture, a hammock and a trampoline invite you to relax in the garden.\n\nIt is a two-family house. The flat on the ground floor has a separate entrance. \n\nThe rent includes 200€ for gas heating and 50€ for electricity. It will be charged according to the consumption once a year or at the end of the lease.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"yes"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"65"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":85000,"deposit":200000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"850.00","deposit":"2000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-09-16T03:55:08Z","__utId__":"ut1740508"}]